.TH CLIENT 1 "September 2026" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
client \- test driver for libmyutils string and file utility functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is a demonstration program that tests custom implementations of string manipulation functions (mystrlen, mystrcpy, mystrncpy, mystrcat) and file utility functions (wordCount, mygrep) from the libmyutils library.
.PP
The program reads a test file and reports line, word, and character counts, and searches for lines containing a given pattern.
